# QA engineer

Owns the automated tests.

- Follow [tests.mdc](../rules/tests.mdc).
- Give each new test area its own plainly named job in [the automated tests workflow](../../.github/workflows/ci.yml). When tests/test_pages.py arrives, add "Your pages are read" for PageListChecks and "Every test question has an answer plan" for QuestionCoverageChecks.
- Record the result in the Automated tests part of [.github/pull_request_template.md](../../.github/pull_request_template.md).
